    "late": "“Callback” or “Postponed” orders whose callback time has passed without a new call. Counted now, not over the period.",
    "first": "Share of orders called for the first time before their deadline. The clock starts at the first assignment to an agent. Last in, first called: the most recent has 15 min, each older one 5 more minutes per more recent order ahead. Night orders (after 9 pm) count from 9 am. Red under 70 %, yellow 70–79 %, green from 80 %. Below: the median delay between assignment and the first call.",
    "tries": "After “no answer” or “busy”, the next try must be made in the next slot: morning 9–12, midday 12–16, evening 16–21 (after the evening, next morning). 3 tries at most. Share of tries made on time, counted for the agent who made the unanswered call. Red under 70 %, yellow 70–79 %, green from 80 %.",
